[[Keiran Thackeray]] is interested in [[Votive Candle]]s.

==Acquisition==
Six are given by [[Necromancer Munne]] in exchange for 3 [[Honeycomb]]s, in [[Sardelac Sanitarium]].

==Collectors==
{{:Lieutenant Thackeray/Collector}}
{{clear}}
{{:Lieutenant Thackeray/Collector2}}

==Notes==
*'''Beware of scams when buying this item!'''
**These candles are labeled "''Hand crafted by Necromancer Munne.''"
**Votive Candles found in pre-Searing are labeled "Quest item". These ''can't'' be given to Thackeray.
*Necromancer Munne will not trade Honeycombs for candles until you have spoken to Lieutenant Thackeray about collecting the candles.
{{bug|If the candles are separated into multiple stacks, Thackeray offers to accept, but is unable to give a Paper Wrapped Parcel. Afterward, he will trade the candles for Sacks of Random Junk, as if he had given the parcel.}}

